license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: "Cognoscenti is a benchmark for cognitive and emergent memory systems. It evaluates whether memory systems activate useful context, suppress stale or misleading context, consolidate repeated experience, adapt to new facts, resist interference, and remain efficient under use."
